<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3733/43 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.6924/29 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9024/34 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4200/05 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     34.94/95  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.6985/05   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1669.4/0.4  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     115.60/65   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.6025/75   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0406/26   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4472/92   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6360/70</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$343.80/30</p>
